  <dda.quest.bulkhead.title>舱壁修补单</dda.quest.bulkhead.title>
  <dda.quest.bulkhead.desc>泵房的舱壁又渗水了。带上钢材来找主管，在材料一栏点击「上交」，可以分批交付。交齐三份后，点击「提交」领取报酬。</dda.quest.bulkhead.desc>
  <dda.quest.bulkhead.quote>“先把水堵上，表格可以晚点填。”</dda.quest.bulkhead.quote>
  <dda.quest.bulkhead.obj.plates>备齐修补用钢材</dda.quest.bulkhead.obj.plates>
  <dda.quest.soundings.title>港口测深回执</dda.quest.soundings.title>
  <dda.quest.soundings.desc>下一程请进入一座城市的港区。靠港记录会随航海日志发回调度台，届时可以远程提交。</dda.quest.soundings.desc>
  <dda.quest.soundings.obj.port>进入城市港口</dda.quest.soundings.obj.port>
  <dda.quest.soundings.location>任一城市港区</dda.quest.soundings.location>
  <dda.quest.samples.title>矿样补货</dda.quest.samples.title>
  <dda.quest.samples.desc>补给商需要两块完整的硝石矿样作库存比对。备好后到普通前哨站商店交付，可重复接取。</dda.quest.samples.desc>
  <dda.quest.samples.obj.ore>交付硝石矿样</dda.quest.samples.obj.ore>
  <dda.quest.watch.title>航道清障</dda.quest.watch.title>
  <dda.quest.watch.desc>爬行者群正在接近进港航线。由本船船员击败三只爬行者后，通过无线电领取悬赏。</dda.quest.watch.desc>
  <dda.quest.watch.quote>“声呐上少三个回波，我就签字。”</dda.quest.watch.quote>
  <dda.quest.watch.obj.crawlers>由本船船员击败爬行者</dda.quest.watch.obj.crawlers>
